# deploy/ — Deployment and Rollback Scripts
#
# This directory will contain shell scripts used by the Jenkins pipeline.
# Populated in Phase 4.
#
# Expected structure:
#   deploy/
#   ├── deploy.sh            — Main deployment script
#   ├── rollback.sh          — Rollback to previous stable release
#   └── verify_recovery.sh   — Post-rollback recovery verification
#
# IMPORTANT: All .sh files use Unix (LF) line endings — enforced by .gitattributes
